# NOTE: the generated post pages (blog/posts/, math/math-posts/,
# english/english_posts/, coding/coding_posts/) and the *_posts.json indexes are
# NOT ignored on purpose -- GitHub Pages serves this repo as-is, so the build
# output of scripts/convert.py has to be committed for the site to work.

